await write('docs/intelligence/silicon-valley-cxo-ecosystem.html',shell('Intelligence: silicon-valley-cxo-ecosystem',`<section class="prose wide"><div class="eyebrow">GEOGRAPHIC INTELLIGENCE</div><h1>Silicon Valley CXO Ecosystem</h1><blockquote>The index currently identifies ${siliconValleyEntities.length} organizations with documented headquarters or operating geography in Silicon Valley, San Francisco, Palo Alto, San Jose, or the Bay Area. Headquarters and operating-market signals remain distinct in the downloadable cohort.</blockquote><div class="stats compact"><div><strong>${siliconValleyEntities.length}</strong><span>Organizations</span></div><div><strong>${new Set(siliconValleyEntities.flatMap(entity=>entity.categories)).size}</strong><span>Provider categories</span></div><div><strong>${new Set(siliconValleyEntities.flatMap(entity=>entity.cxo_roles)).size}</strong><span>CXO roles</span></div></div><h2>Provider distribution</h2><div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>Provider category</th><th>Organizations</th></tr></thead><tbody>${siliconCategories.map(([category,count])=>`<tr><td>${esc(category)}</td><td>${count}</td></tr>`).join('')}</tbody></table></div><h2>CXO distribution</h2><p>${siliconRoles.map(([role,count])=>`${esc(role)} ${count}`).join(' · ')}</p><h2>Canonical cohort</h2><div class="grid">${siliconValleyEntities.map(entityCard).join('').replaceAll('href="entities/','href="../entities/')}</div><h2>Download cohort</h2><p><a href="../data/cohorts/silicon-valley-cxo-ecosystem.csv">CSV</a> · <a href="../data/cohorts/silicon-valley-cxo-ecosystem.json">JSON</a></p><h2>Methodology</h2><p>Generated from canonical headquarters and geography fields in dataset ${DATASET_VERSION}. Presence in this cohort does not imply headquarters unless the entity record explicitly provides it.</p></section>`,'Canonical organizations and provider distribution across the Silicon Valley CXO ecosystem.','Silicon Valley CXO Ecosystem'));

